# SurvNG installation

Pick **one** path. Do not run Docker and `survng.service` on the same cameras at
the same time.

| Install | Guide |
| --- | --- |
| Published container image (recommended for a dedicated NVR host) | [README.install.docker.md](README.install.docker.md) |
| Native Python venv + systemd | [README.install.systemd.md](README.install.systemd.md) |

Commands in those guides are meant to be pasted in order. Set the variables in
the first block of the guide you chose, then paste each later block as-is.

Related notes: [docs/docker.md](docs/docker.md), [docker/README.md](docker/README.md),
[docs/storage.md](docs/storage.md), and the [support-bundle guide](README.md#support-bundle).
